   "scene": "board",
   "text": "7月，董事会增至11席。",
   "start": 43.119,
   "end": 45.685
  },
  {
   "id": "board.one",
   "scene": "board",
   "text": "在这张桌子上，黄仁勋只有一票。",
   "start": 46.085,
   "end": 48.723
  },
  {
